        <head>Cn 1018</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">And sy ælc wuduwe þe hy silfe mid rihte gehealde. on godes griðe 7 on ðæs cynges.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">And let every widow who conducts herself in a proper manner be in the protection of God and the king.</ab>
